  "description": "An independent, unofficial .NET client library for the Tesla™ Powerwall™ API. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Tesla, for .NET applications targeting both .NET Framework 4.7.2 and .NET 10. Behavioral and compatibility reference work draws on the upstream Python pypowerwall project and its public documentation.",
