  "releaseNotes": "Add nullable PW2 instantaneous available charge/discharge power in watts through June 2024 TEDAPI and show it in the console. Preserve real zeroes and leave incomplete or unavailable totals null. Floor scaled battery levels at zero below the 5% reserve. Existing signatures, assembly identity and runtime dependencies remain compatible; June 2026 query captures are unchanged. PW2 validation is offline. See RELEASE-NOTES.md.",
